      "name": "dsh-dfy",
      "title": "dsh-Dfy",
      "description": {
        "en": "All-in-one companion for the DSH web GUI: balance whale widget with usage and per-turn cost, a 106-clip transparent desktop pet, a QQ message card bridged through SnowLuma, Bilibili dynamics/comments with a fish guard, and local redacted memory. One plugin; data stays on this machine. Requires DSH >= 0.2.1-rc.2 (verified on 0.2.2-rc.1).",
        "zh": "一体化的 DSH 桌面伴侣：小鲸鱼余额挂件（含今日已用与每轮消耗）、106 段透明动画桌宠、经 SnowLuma 桥接的 QQ 消息卡、B站动态与评论互动（鱼群保护），以及本机双向脱敏记忆。单个插件，数据只存本机。需要 DSH ≥ 0.2.1-rc.2（已在 0.2.2-rc.1 实测）。"
      },
